### ============================================================
### REVIEWS TEST FLOW — Chat 08
### Δεδομένα: appt #1-4 → vasilis (id 8), appt #5 → katerina (id 11)
### Τρέξε με σειρά. Το login αποθηκεύει το token αυτόματα.
### ============================================================

### 1. LOGIN ως vasilis (owner των appt #1-4)
# @name loginVasilis
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "vasilis@example.com",
  "password": "customer123"
}

> {%
    // ⚠️ Προσάρμοσε "token" στο πεδίο του AuthResponse σου (token ή accessToken)
    client.global.set("vasilisToken", response.body.token);
%}

### ============================================================
### 2. POST review σε ΔΙΚΟ ΤΟΥ COMPLETED ραντεβού (#1) → 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vasilisToken}}

{
  "appointmentId": 1,
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent service, very professional!"
}

### ============================================================
### 3. POST ΞΑΝΑ το ίδιο (#1) → 409 Conflict "already reviewed"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vasilisToken}}

{
  "appointmentId": 1,
  "rating": 3,
  "comment": "Trying to review twice"
}

### ============================================================
### 4. POST σε ΞΕΝΟ ραντεβού (#5, της katerina) → 403 Forbidden (OWNERSHIP, D52)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vasilisToken}}

{
  "appointmentId": 5,
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "This is not my appointment"
}

### ============================================================
### 5. POST με invalid rating (0) → 400 Bad Request (@Min validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vasilisToken}}

{
  "appointmentId": 2,
  "rating": 0,
  "comment": "Invalid rating"
}

### ============================================================
### 6. POST με rating εκτός ορίου (6) → 400 Bad Request (@Max validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vasilisToken}}

{
  "appointmentId": 2,
  "rating": 6
}

### ============================================================
### 7. POST valid #2 (μόνο rating, χωρίς comment) → 201 (comment nullable)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{vasilisToken}}

{
  "appointmentId": 2,
  "rating": 4
}

### ============================================================
### 8. GET τα δικά μου reviews → 200, βλέπω #1 και #2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reviews/me
Authorization: Bearer {{vasilisToken}}

### ============================================================
### 9. GET reviews ανά υπάλληλο — ΧΩΡΙΣ token (PUBLIC) → 200 + average
### ⚠️ Άλλαξε το {employeeId} — δες σημείωση κάτω για το σωστό id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees/1/reviews

### ============================================================
### 10. GET admin reviews με CUSTOMER token → 403 (δεν είναι admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{vasilisToken}}

### ============================================================
### 11. LOGIN ως admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@kratisimo.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token);
%}

### ============================================================
### 12. GET admin reviews με ADMIN token → 200, ΜΕ customerName
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 13. POST σε CONFIRMED (μελλοντικό) ραντεβού → 400 "only completed"
### ⚠️ Χρειάζεσαι id ενός CONFIRMED ραντεβού του vasilis — δες SQL κάτω
# POST http://localhost:8080/api/reviews
# Content-Type: application/json
# Authorization: Bearer {{vasilisToken}}
#
# {
#   "appointmentId": <CONFIRMED_ID>,
#   "rating": 5
# }